{"type":"message","id":"5b3284f8","parentId":"4f21c080","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:34:55.746Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the full picture. Let me analyze each position's TP/SL that was recently submitted:\n\n**DOT (Short)**: 入场 1.1910\n- 止损: 1.2148 (离入场 +2.0%)\n- 止盈: 1.1672 (离入场 -2.0%)\n- 盈亏比: ~1:1\n\n**ETH (Long)**: 入场 2038.17\n- 止损: 1997.4066 (离入场 -2.0%)\n- 止盈: 2078.9334 (离入场 +2.0%)\n- 盈亏比: ~1:1\n\n**XRP (Short)**: 入场 1.3578\n- 止损: 1.385 (离入场 +2.0%)\n- 止盈: 1.3306 (离入场 -2.0%)\n- 盈亏比: ~1:1\n\n**BTC (Short)**: 入场 73157.7\n- 止损: 74620.854 (离入场 +2.0%)\n- 止盈: 71694.546 (离入场 -2.0%)\n- 盈亏比: ~1:1\n\nEvery single position has exactly ±2% TP/SL, which gives a 1:1 risk/reward ratio. The SOUL.md says the minimum is 盈亏比≥1.5:1.\n\nThe husband is right - these are all 1:1. The standard should be at least 1.5:1 per the config.\n\nAnd the BTC is currently in a losing position (entry 73157.7, mark 73240.67 as short), and its TP at 71694.55 is 2% away while SL at 74620.85 is also 2% away. The stop is closer to being hit since price went against the short.\n\nLet me now look at the code that calculates these TP/SL values. I need to find where these \"Algo 单\" are submitted.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_LdBGvMZIqudUGEbIVn7k4216","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && grep -n 'Algo' crypto_signal_monitor.py | head -20","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":2895,"output":950,"cacheRead":37504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41349,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780115685987}}
