{"type":"message","id":"2261dde5","parentId":"200c1abb","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:35:02.953Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ET_t1zTlgxNJiYSfyKGgRsb1886","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","offset":572,"limit":100}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":182,"output":93,"cacheRead":41344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41619,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780115700028}}
{"type":"message","id":"4ae8e9cb","parentId":"2261dde5","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:35:03.120Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ET_t1zTlgxNJiYSfyKGgRsb1886","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def calc_tp_sl(\n    entry: float,\n    direction: str,\n    ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}\n    \n    2026-03-28 老公指示：固定百分比止盈止损 + 全平\n    - 止盈：+4%（TP1 全平 100%）\n    - 止损：-2%\n    - 无 TP2（已废弃）\n    \"\"\"\n    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 2026-03-30 老公指示：改回 4%（8U）\n    STOP_LOSS_PCT   = 0.02  # 2%\n    \n    if direction == \"LONG\":\n        tp1 = entry * (1 + TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)  # 做多 +4%\n        sl  = entry * (1 - STOP_LOSS_PCT)    # 做多 -2%\n    else:\n        tp1 = entry * (1 - TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)  # 做空 -4%\n        sl  = entry * (1 + STOP_LOSS_PCT)    # 做空 +2%\n\n    return {\n        \"tp1_price\": round(tp1, 4),\n        \"sl_price\":  round(sl, 4),\n        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,   # 移动止盈用\n    }\n\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 七、止盈止损检查（15秒必跑，极轻量）\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\ndef check_exits_fast(positions: list, prices: dict) -> list[tuple]:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 [(position, reason, close_size_ratio)]\n    纯价格比较，无任何计算，<5ms\n    \n    2026-03-28 老公指示：TP1 全平，无 TP2\n    \"\"\"\n    exits = []\n    for pos in positions:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        p   = prices.get(sym, {}).get(\"price\")\n        if not p:\n            continue\n\n        tp1 = pos[\"tp1_price\"]\n        sl  = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n        \n        # 跳过止盈止损为 0 的无效持仓\n        if tp1 == 0.0 or sl == 0.0:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {sym} 止盈止损无效 (TP1={tp1}, SL={sl})，跳过检查\")\n            continue\n        \n        typ = pos[\"type\"]\n\n        if typ == \"LONG\":\n            if p >= tp1:\n                exits.append((pos, \"TP1\", 1.0))  # 全平\n            elif p <= sl:\n                exits.append((pos, \"SL\", 1.0))   # 全平\n        else:  # SHORT\n            if p <= tp1:\n                exits.append((pos, \"TP1\", 1.0))  # 全平\n            elif p >= sl:\n                exits.append((pos, \"SL\", 1.0))   # 全平\n\n    return exits\n\n\ndef update_trailing_stop(positions: list, prices: dict):\n    \"\"\"\n    移动止盈 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：三档移动止盈（从峰值价回撤）\n    2% → 回撤 0.8% → 锁定 1.2%\n    3% → 回撤 1% → 锁定 2% ⭐️ 老公指示\n    4% → 全平\n    \n    2026-03-31 老公指示：每次更新 sl_price 后同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新单）\n    \"\"\"\n    for pos in positions:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        p   = prices.get(sym, {}).get(\"price\")\n        if not p:\n            continue\n\n        entry = pos[\"entry_price\"]\n        typ   = pos[\"type\"]\n\n        pnl_pct = (p - entry) / entry if typ == \"LONG\" else (entry - p) / entry\n\n        # 更新峰值盈亏 和 峰值价格\n        if pnl_pct > pos.get(\"peak_pnl\", 0):\n            pos[\"peak_pnl\"] = pnl_pct\n            pos[\"peak_price\"] = p  # ✅ 记录峰值价格\n\n        # 找到当前利润对应的档位（取最高档）\n        active_tier = None\n        peak_pnl = pos.get(\"peak_pnl\", 0)  # ✅ 兼容旧数据\n\n[1856 more lines in file. Use offset=672 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780115703062}}
{"type":"message","id":"971eaed0","parentId":"4ae8e9cb","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:35:29.157Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the issue clearly. The `calc_tp_sl` function is using **fixed percentages**:\n- TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04 (4%)\n- STOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.02 (2%)\n\nThis gives a 2:1 risk/reward ratio. But that's **not** what the log shows. Let me check what's actually being used...\n\nLooking at the log again:\n- DOT (Short) entry 1.191: SL=1.2148 (+2.0%), TP=1.1672 (-2.0%)\n- ETH (Long) entry 2038.17: SL=1997.41 (-2.0%), TP=2078.93 (+2.0%)\n- XRP (Short) entry 1.3578: SL=1.3850 (+2.0%), TP=1.3306 (-2.0%)\n- BTC (Short) entry 73157.7: SL=74620.85 (+2.0%), TP=71694.55 (-2.0%)\n\nWait... For DOT:\n- 如果SL是 +2%, 那么 SL = 1.191 * 1.02 = 1.2148 ✓\n- 如果TP是 -4%, 那么 TP = 1.191 * 0.96 = 1.1434 ✗ (日志显示 1.1672)\n\n1.1672 / 1.191 = 0.980... 那是 -2%！\n\nSo DOT的TP也是 -2% from entry (1.191 * 0.98 = 1.1672), SL是 +2% (1.191 * 1.02 = 1.2148).\n\nThis means **all positions have ±2% TP/SL = 1:1 risk/reward**.\n\nBut the code says `TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04` and `STOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.02`. So why is the log showing 2% TP instead of 4%?\n\nLet me look more carefully. Maybe there's somewhere else that overrides the TP, or the `calc_tp_sl` function isn't the right one being called.\n\nActually wait - let me look at the DOT position. The logs show:\n- DOT开了好几个仓位，平了又开。Let me look at this more carefully.\n\nDOT position:\n- 09:20: Algo单 SL=1.2158, TP=1.1682\n- 入场价在日志中后来是 1.1910\n\nBut the DOT position that was closed at 10:13 had entry 1.1920, was stopped out at 1.2160 (-2.01%).\n\nThen new DOT opened, and at 10:16: SL=1.1917, TP=1.2403. \n1.1917 / 1.1910 = 1.0006... hmm that doesn't make sense for SL.\n\nWait, let me re-read. For a SHORT position:\n- SL 1.1917 means \"if price rises to 1.1917\", entry was probably ~1.188 or so\n- Actually entry 1.191: SL 1.1917 = +0.06%, that's super tight!\n\nThen after being stopped out at 12:27, new DOT position:\n- Entry: 1.191 (current position), SL=1.2148, TP=1.1672\n- SL: 1.2148/1.191 = 1.0200 (+2.0%)\n- TP: 1.1672/1.191 = 0.9800 (-2.0%)\n\nSo these are indeed 1:1!\n\nWait, let me look more carefully at the DOT stop out at 12:27:\n- SL triggered at 1.1910, entry was 1.2160. For a SHORT, this means entry was 1.2160 and it hit SL when price RISES to 1.1910 (no, price going up on a short is bad).\n\nActually wait, I'm confusing myself. Let me re-read:\n```\n平仓 DOT SL | 入场:1.2160 出场:1.1910 | PnL:-2.06%\n```\n\nFor a short:\n- Entry: 1.2160\n- Close: 1.1910\n- PnL = (1.2160 - 1.1910) / 1.2160 = 0.025/1.216 = 2.06% gain!\n\nBut the log says \"-2.06% PnL\". That's weird. Unless this is a LONG position?\n\nWait no, the current DOT position is SHORT (-152.8). Let me re-check...\n\nHmm, actually the log says \"平仓 DOT SL | 入场:1.2160 出场:1.1910 | PnL:-2.06%\". If this is a SHORT with entry 1.2160 and close 1.1910, then: (1.216-1.191)/1.216 = +2.06%. But log says -2.06%.\n\nUnless the reporting has the direction wrong. Or maybe the position was reversed at some point and the entry/exit are swapped.\n\nAnyway, the core issue the husband identified is clear: all current positions have TP/SL at exactly ±2%, giving 1:1 risk/reward, but the code says TP should be 4%.\n\nLet me look for a bug. Let me search for where TP percentage might have been changed to 2% or where it's being set differently.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_RP2fzLLc8kPWGHnodcYm5558","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && grep -n 'TAKE_PROFIT\\|STOP_LOSS\\|0\\.04\\|0\\.02\\|tp_pct\\|sl_pct\\|止盈比\\|止损比' crypto_signal_monitor.py","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1189,"output":2525,"cacheRead":41472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45186,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780115703164}}
