{"type":"message","id":"d57e6bca","parentId":"86df8d98","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:36:08.713Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now the fix is complete. But the current positions still have the old 1:1 TP/SL. The positions are already in place with wrong values, and they'll only be fixed when the position is rebuilt (after a close/reopen or direction change sync). \n\nThe monitor needs to be restarted for the fix to take effect. And even after restart, the existing positions need to have their Algo orders re-submitted with correct values.\n\nLet me tell the husband what I found and fixed. But according to AGENTS.md, I should remind him to restart (kj) but not suggest it as a destructive action - or wait, kj restart is recommended after code changes by AGENTS.md.\n\nLet me just tell him the bug and fix, and that he needs to restart for it to take effect on new positions. For existing positions, he might want to manually fix the TP/SL.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"修好了。问题出在仓位 API 同步重建代码里，TP 被硬编码为 2% 而不是 `calc_tp_sl` 里的正确值 4%。每次仓位重建就覆盖成 2%/2%，全变 1:1。\n\n**改了什么：**\n- TP 从 2% → 4%（与 `calc_tp_sl` 一致）\n- 删掉了废弃的 tp2 计算\n\n**注意：** 现有的 4 个持仓 TP/SL 已经是错的，需要重启后才会对新仓位生效。现有仓位想修的话得手动干预。需要我帮你重建现有持仓的止盈止损吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":39,"output":507,"cacheRead":47104,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47650,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780115759820}}
