{"type":"message","id":"fc026514","parentId":"31934065","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:46:26.625Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公说BTC没委托，意思是BTC仓位开了但没有止盈止损Algo单。可能因为刚才那个进程被SIGTERM杀掉了，BTC的开仓请求虽然成交了但没来得及提交条件单。\n\n让我检查一下BTC的条件订单。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_10xVR28lirUenkswMSxx3801","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\n# 查 BTC 的条件订单\nresult = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/openOrders', {'symbol': 'BTCUSDT'})\nprint('BTC 普通挂单:', result)\n\n# 查条件订单\ntry:\n    result2 = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/conditional/openOrders', {'symbol': 'BTCUSDT'})\n    print('BTC 条件订单:', result2)\nexcept Exception as e:\n    # fallback\n    try:\n        result2 = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/conditional/openOrder', {'symbol': 'BTCUSDT'})\n        print('BTC 条件订单:', result2)\n    except Exception as e2:\n        print(f'查不了: {e2}')\n\n# BTC 当前持仓\nresult3 = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk')\nfor p in result3:\n    if isinstance(p, dict) and p.get('symbol','') == 'BTCUSDT':\n        print(f'BTC持仓: amt={p[\\\"positionAmt\\\"]}, entry={p[\\\"entryPrice\\\"]}, mark={p[\\\"markPrice\\\"]}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":4298,"output":443,"cacheRead":55296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60037,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780116378481}}
