{"type":"message","id":"bb971920","parentId":"e7e6dddd","timestamp":"2026-05-30T04:46:44.832Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"BTC确实没有条件订单。手动提交 BTC 的止盈止损。BTC SHORT, entry 73252, quantity 0.003.\n\n- TP: 73252 * 0.96 = 70321.92\n- SL: 73252 * 1.02 = 74717.04\n\n需要为BTC提交STOP_MARKET止损和TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET止盈。BTC精度是3位小数，但TP/SL价格不需要精度限制，只需要round到合适位数。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_JjFlr6GKB46HeMEs890z6054","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\n# BTC SHORT, entry 73252, qty 0.003\nentry = 73252.0\nqty = 0.003\n\n# TP = -4%, SL = +2%\ntp = round(entry * 0.96, 4)\nsl = round(entry * 1.02, 4)\nprint(f'BTC SHORT: entry={entry}, TP={tp} (-4%), SL={sl} (+2%)')\n\n# 提交止损\nsl_r = bat.request('POST', '/fapi/v1/conditional/order', {\n    'symbol': 'BTCUSDT',\n    'side': 'BUY',\n    'type': 'STOP_MARKET',\n    'stopPrice': str(sl),\n    'quantity': str(qty),\n    'workingType': 'CONTRACT_PRICE',\n    'reduceOnly': 'true',\n})\nprint(f'SL result: {sl_r}')\n\n# 提交止盈\ntp_r = bat.request('POST', '/fapi/v1/conditional/order', {\n    'symbol': 'BTCUSDT',\n    'side': 'BUY',\n    'type': 'TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET',\n    'stopPrice': str(tp),\n    'quantity': str(qty),\n    'workingType': 'CONTRACT_PRICE',\n    'reduceOnly': 'true',\n})\nprint(f'TP result: {tp_r}')\nprint('✅ BTC 止盈止损已补上')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":458,"output":624,"cacheRead":59904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60986,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780116395461}}
