{"type":"message","id":"fd3432ef","parentId":"e2031315","timestamp":"2026-05-30T05:56:04.419Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me summarize:\n\n1. Health check: 12/13 OK, ⚠️ 1 异常 - 看门狗 (watchdog) 未运行\n2. Positions: 4 个持仓，全部正常\n   - DOT SHORT: 浮亏 -2.48U\n   - ETH LONG: 浮盈 +1.17U\n   - XRP SHORT: 浮亏 -1.20U\n   - BTC SHORT: 浮亏 -1.02U\n3. Logs: 无错误/异常日志\n\nThe only issue is the watchdog (crypto_monitor_watchdog.py) is down. This is the process that monitors the signal monitor and restarts it if it crashes. Since the signal monitor itself is running fine, this isn't critical right now but should be fixed.\n\nThe signal monitor itself is running and scoring, just no trades triggered in the last 10 minutes (market quiet period).\n\nOverall: system is basically fine, biggest concern is the watchdog being down. No errors in the logs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"整体还行，13 项检查 12 个绿灯。日志也干净，没有报错。\n\n**唯一问题：看门狗挂了 🔴**\n`crypto_monitor_watchdog.py` 不在进程里，主监控虽然还活着但没人盯着它，万一挂了不会自动复活。\n\n**持仓情况：**\n- DOT SHORT 浮亏 -2.48U（价格冲上 1.204 了）\n- ETH LONG 浮盈 +1.17U\n- XRP SHORT 浮亏 -1.20U\n- BTC SHORT 浮亏 -1.02U\n\n信号正常评分中，只是最近 10 分钟没有触发交易动作。回去重启时会一起把看门狗拉起来 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":921,"output":603,"cacheRead":73728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75252,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780120554650}}
