{"type":"message","id":"5891b9b2","parentId":"29226168","timestamp":"2026-05-30T05:59:27.915Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The watchdog stopped logging at 12:51:08. The main monitor (PID 13623) was the one being watched. The watchdog's PID was 8482, which no longer exists.\n\nIt looks like the watchdog was running fine up until 12:51, and then just stopped. No error, no crash message, no OOM kill in dmesg. It just... stopped logging.\n\nThis timing is right after we did the \"close all + re-open\" operation (12:43-12:47). The watchdog continued running for a few minutes after that and then died around 12:51.\n\nPossible causes:\n1. The `close-all` + `open` commands might have briefly disrupted the market state or the monitor process, and the watchdog might have gotten confused\n2. The testnet might have had SSL issues around that time (I saw some SSL errors in the earlier logs around 10:54-11:25)\n3. The watchdog might have used a resource that was temporarily locked or unavailable\n\nThe watchdog stopped cleanly without error logging - no traceback, no exception. Just stopped.\n\nSince there's no crash evidence, it might have been killed by something external or it might have hung on a network call and been terminated by the kernel.\n\nBut the key finding is: the watchdog was watching the monitor (PID 13623), and the monitor is still running fine. The watchdog just died. Since the monitor itself is healthy, this isn't critical. `kj` will restart everything including the watchdog.\n\nLet me tell the husband what I found.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"看门狗日志停在 12:51，最后一条还是正常的\"💓 心跳正常\"，然后就悄无声息没了——没有报错、没有 traceback、也没有被 OOM 杀掉。\n\n我猜是刚才那一波平仓重开操作（12:43-12:47）期间，测试网 SSL 抖了一下（之前日志里也出现过 SSL 错误），看门狗可能碰巧在那时做了个网络调用挂住了，然后被系统回收了。\n\n好在它盯着的 signal monitor（PID 13623）还活得好好的，只是没了复活保险。回去 `kj` 重启全家就回来了 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1466,"output":781,"cacheRead":76032,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78279,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780120754803}}
